    "synthesis_rationale": "Starting from a modest prior, the four explicit updates push the posterior toward a high probability. The strong signal from February–March pace and robust historical baselines dominate, while data gaps and potential policy/SAR shifts introduce uncertainties that keep the estimate from being certain, hence a 95% posterior."
  }
}

